<title>UK: SOCCER-LEADING ENGLISH LEAGUE GOALSCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING ENGLISH LEAGUE GOALSCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in English premier league soccer after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>10 - Ian Wright (Arsenal)</p>
<p>9 - Fabrizio Ravanelli (Middlesbrough)</p>
<p>8 - Matthew Le Tissier (Southampton), Alan Shearer (Newcastle)</p>
<p>7 - Les Ferdinand (Newcastle), Gianluca Vialli (Chelsea)</p>
<p>6 - Marcus Gayle (Wimbledon), Gary Speed (Everton), Dwight Yorke (Aston (Villa), Robbie Earle (Wimbledon), Efan Ekoku</p>
<p>(Wimbledon).</p>
